sequenceDiagram
    participant Author
    participant Studio
    participant Canon
    participant Audits
    participant Workflow
    Author->>Studio: Propose material change
    Studio->>Canon: Calculate affected records
    Canon-->>Studio: Impact set
    Studio-->>Author: Diff and consequences
    Author->>Studio: Approve with rationale
    Studio->>Canon: Append new version
    Studio->>Audits: Invalidate dependent runs
    Studio->>Workflow: Block downstream nodes
    Workflow-->>Author: Re-audit required
